          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Dymatize Super Mass Gainer does what a mass gainer should: 1,280 calories and 52 g of protein in one shake, at about $3.42 to $3.90 per 1,000 calories, the lowest calorie cost among the big gainers we priced. It beats Serious Mass on price and protein blend, and loses only on creatine, which you can add separately for pennies.
          </p>
